# Raw archive downloads are never committed. They are large, they belong to
# their original publishers, and every one of them is re-fetchable from the
# DOI / URL recorded in data_sources/SOURCES.md. Reproducibility comes from
# the fetch scripts, not from vendoring other people's data.
data/raw/
data/interim/
*.zip
*.xlsx
*.parquet
*.sqlite3
*.db

# Derived results ARE committed (they are small and they are the point):
!results/**

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
